WEBVTT

00:12:28.787 --> 00:12:30.579
but now, he said, he was religious,

00:12:30.579 --> 00:12:32.204
and God was pleased.

00:12:33.121 --> 00:12:35.746
It was then that God intervened:

00:12:35.787 --> 00:12:37.621
news on the TV of a car wreck

00:12:37.662 --> 00:12:40.871
that hours before had killed
three people up north.

00:12:41.704 --> 00:12:43.371
We looked up at the wreckage.

00:12:44.329 --> 00:12:46.037
"Strange," I said.

00:12:46.829 --> 00:12:48.496
"Strange," he agreed.

00:12:49.912 --> 00:12:52.787
I had the thought
that there, on Route 804,

00:12:52.787 --> 00:12:54.537
there were perpetrators and victims,

00:12:54.579 --> 00:12:56.204
dyads bound by a crash.

00:12:56.246 --> 00:12:58.579
Some, as had Abed, would forget the date.

00:12:58.621 --> 00:13:00.746
Some, as had I, would remember.